
<div class="page-header">
  <a href="/students" class="btn btn-ghost">← 返回列表</a>
</div>

<div class="form-container">
  <h3>批量导入用户</h3>
  <p class="text-muted">粘贴 JSON 格式的用户数据，可导入学生、教师或执行教师：</p>
  <div class="code-block">
    [<br>
    &nbsp;&nbsp;{"real_name": "张三", "role": "student", "school_id": 1, "class_id": 1},<br>
    &nbsp;&nbsp;{"real_name": "李四", "role": "teacher", "school_id": 1, "class_id": 2}<br>
    ]
  </div>

  <form method="POST" action="/students/import" class="standard-form">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="data">用户数据（JSON格式）</label>
      <textarea id="data" name="data" rows="10" required placeholder='[{"real_name":"姓名","role":"student","school_id":1,"class_id":1}]'></textarea>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted">默认密码：pbl123456；登录使用姓名+密码</p>
    <div class="form-actions">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">批量导入</button>
      <a href="/students" class="btn btn-ghost">取消</a>
    </div>
  </form>
</div>
